{"id":"vod_lz_54368","vodId":"54368","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"日常","name_cn":"日常","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230318-1/8bd198221c2a4a363015a5e42464520b.jpg"},"summary":"表面上看来，东云名乃（古谷静佳 配音）是一个外表可爱又有点天然呆的黑发女孩，可是，她背后醒目的发条暴露了她的真实身份——由博士（今野宏美 配音）所改造的少女机器人。虽然对于自己背后的发条感到十分自卑，但博士总是以其非常可爱为由拒绝帮助名乃进行改造。　　在名乃就读的1年纪Q班中，汇聚着名乃的诸多好友们——个性过于活泼以至于经常暴走的相生祐子（本多真梨子 配音），常常陷于对同性恋情的幻想之中的美术型女生长野原美绪（相泽舞 配音），以及外表沉默安静内里腹黑毒舌的三好学生水上麻衣（富樫美铃 配音）。就这样，经常处于脱线状态的日常和激烈的吐槽在这三人之间展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-03-18 08:45:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13224_75d9217b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13225_7effeb32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13226_2353e48e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13227_0e4b9b2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13228_1011d998/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13229_a042fbe8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13230_3c61d0e3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13231_c8583a7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13232_fe9d9d52/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13233_ff473fba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13234_24e5b99d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13235_24a666e1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13236_106615bd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230317/13237_dc5279b4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"ht